<!DOCTYPE HTML>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8" />
	<link rel="shortcut icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon.ico">
	<title>BitHub</title>
	<link href="/bower_components/bootstrap/dist/css/bootstrap.css" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css">
	<link href="/bower_components/bootstrap/dist/css/bootstrap-theme.css" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css">
	<link href="/stylesheets/app.css" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css">
</head>
<body>
	<div id="wrapper">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="row header clearfix">
				<img src="/images/logo.png" class="logo">
				<ul class="list-unstyled">
					<li><a href="#features">Features</a></li>
					<li><a href="/pricing">Pricing</a></li>
					<li><a href="/register">Register</a></li>
					<li><a href="/login">Login</a></li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<div class="row punchline clearfix">
				<h1>
					<b>Real time</b>, embeddable, social feeds. <b>Starting at $19 / month</b>.
				</h1>
				<a href="/register" class="btn btn-lg btn-primary">Find out more &raquo;</a>
			</div>
			<div class="row widget-wrap">
				<img src="/images/placeholders/widget.png" alt="">
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="bottom-part">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="row">
					<a href="javascript://" class="expand-widget">
						<span class="glyphicon glyphicon-chevron-down"></span>
					</a>
					<p class="marketing-line">
						All the content you produce is scattered across multiple social networks. BitHub allows you to combine it into one unifed feed, and embed it in your site. <b>Build your social proof, and strengthen your community!</b>
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="row clearfix steps">
					
					<div class="step">
						<b class="counter">1</b>
						<p>Connect your social accounts to aggregate data.</p>
					</div>

					<div class="step">
						<b class="counter">2</b>
						<p>Set up the moderation rules and keep your content focused.</p>
					</div>

					<div class="step">
						<b class="counter">3</b>
						<p>Embed the widgets in your HTML page. Multiple themes available.</p>
					</div>

				</div>
				<div class="row cta">
					<a href="/register" class="btn btn-primary btn lg">Start your 45 day trial!</a>
					<br>
					<span>Or read more about the features</span>
				</div>
				<div class="features">
					<div class="feature-right clearfix">
						<div class="content">
							<h2>Aggregate everything</h2>
							<p>
								BitHub has a powerful aggregation engine which allows you to collect all your content.
							</p>
							<p>
								Twitter, Facebook and Tumblr are just some of the content sources we support. No matter if it’s text, image or video, we can display it in your feed. All of this works in real time.
							</p>
						</div>
						<div class="image-wrap"></div>
					</div>
					<div class="feature-left clearfix">
						<div class="content">
							<h2>Your content, your rules</h2>
							<p>
								Every item we collect is automatically moderated based on the rules you set up. 
							</p>
							<p>
								You can block profanities, or filter the data related to some subject. BitHub puts you in the control of data.
							</p>
							<p>
								Besides the automatic moderation, you can manually moderate any item.
							</p>
						</div>
						<div class="image-wrap"></div>
					</div>
					<div class="feature-right clearfix">
						<div class="content">
							<h2>Embed anywhere</h2>
							<p>
								BitHub allows you to adjust it’s design so it fits in your branding.
							</p>
							<p>
								All content cards are designed to work in both full page and small area context which allows you to reuse your embeds across your site.
							</p>
							<p>
								Pick your layout and theme, and just paste the code into your HTML page and you’re ready to go.
							</p>
						</div>
						<div class="image-wrap"></div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="row cta">
					<a href="/register" class="btn btn-primary btn lg">Start your 45 day trial!</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="footer">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="row">
					<div class="copyright">&copy; BitHub 2014.</div>
					<ul class="service-pages-menu list-unstyled">
						<li><a href="#">Terms of Service</a></li>
						<li><a href="#">Privacy policy</a></li>
						<li><a href="#">Report a  Bug</a></li>
						<li><a href="#">About BitHub</a></li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	
</body>
</html>
